{"id":"73478f2dc71b6e9e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-monotone-circuit.md","title":"Monotone Boolean Functions and Circuits","display":"df-monotone-circuit — Monotone Boolean Functions and Circuits","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-monotone-circuit","aliases":["28-df-monotone-circuit"],"display":"df-monotone-circuit — Monotone Boolean Functions and Circuits","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 14.6 and §14.3 opening","source_printed_pages":"293–294","source_pdf_pages":"319–320","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-monotone-circuit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-monotone-circuit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-monotone-circuit — Monotone Boolean Functions and Circuits"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 14.6 and §14.3 opening"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"293–294"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"319–320"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\">\\(C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>；输入和常量标签沿用该定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\preceq y\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\ x_i\\le y_i,\\qquad\\operatorname{Mon}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\preceq y\\Rightarrow f(x)\\le f(y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\preceq y\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\ x_i\\le y_i,\\qquad\\operatorname{Mon}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\preceq y\\Rightarrow f(x)\\le f(y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MonCirc}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{not}\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MonCirc}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{not}\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MonCirc}(C)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\preceq y\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1\\le\\operatorname{out}_C(y)_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MonCirc}(C)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\preceq y\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1\\le\\operatorname{out}_C(y)_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对拓扑顺序归纳，输入投影、常量、AND、OR都保序，因此单调电路只计算单调函数；允许常量门补足常函数。该定义不主张一般与单调电路规模多项式等价。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 14.6 and §14.3 opening；印刷页 293–294；PDF 页 319–320。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第14章的 Monotone Boolean Functions and Circuits，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>形式接口复核：电路已属于BoolCirc，故排除NOT标签恰好等价于所有非输入非常量门为AND或OR；这里没有通过换符号改变单调电路类别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；输入和常量标签沿用该定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\preceq y\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\ x_i\\le y_i,\\qquad\\operatorname{Mon}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\preceq y\\Rightarrow f(x)\\le f(y)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MonCirc}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{not}\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MonCirc}(C)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\preceq y\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1\\le\\operatorname{out}_C(y)_1).","display":true}],"bytes":2075,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-348","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-mod-m-circuit]]、[[28-thm-razborov-smolensky]]、[[28-df-monotone-circuit]]、[[28-df-kw-relation]]、[[28-thm-kw-depth]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d"]}